{"version":1,"content":"<p>對於絕大多數新能源車主來説，整台車裏成本最高的維修項目，往往就是動力電池的更換，也是養車開支裏最不可控的潛在大額支出。不少在二手車市場殘值只剩幾萬元的舊款電動汽車，單獨更換一整套全新動力電池的報價，甚至能超過車輛本身的二手市價。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586052.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:44:30.453167+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_hash":"3a2081ae7899997652f7b3b94e178bb48184e39062fd2df92c1fbde0119af663","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}